  "solution": {
    "text": "Momentum of incident light per second<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>60</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Momentum of reflected light per second<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>60</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>60</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.2</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Force on the surface = change in momentum per second<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.2</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.2</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>",
